{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3021010030010","name":"円香","text":"────パチパチと\r\n爆ぜる音","trans":"────噼啪噼啪地\n爆开的声音","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030020","name":"円香","text":"夢うつつで、走っていく","trans":"在半梦半醒间，奔跑而去","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"透の母","text":"円香ちゃん！\r\nこんにちはー","trans":"圆香！\n你好啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030030","name":"円香","text":"すみません\r\n浅倉は────","trans":"不好意思\n浅仓她────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"透の母","text":"あれー？\r\n一緒じゃなかったんだ？","trans":"咦——？\n你们没在一起吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"透の母","text":"なんかね、朝お迎えが来て出てったみたい\r\n打ち合わせかなー？","trans":"好像呢，早上有人来接她就出去了\n是去开会吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"透の母","text":"まだ帰ってないよ","trans":"她还没回来哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030060","name":"円香","text":"……浅倉の部屋で待っていてもいいですか","trans":"……我可以在浅仓的房间等她吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"透の母","text":"はーい、どうぞー\r\n────やだ、片付いてるのかなー？","trans":"好——请吧——\n────哎呀，房间收拾过了吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030070","name":"円香","text":"────影絵が走る","trans":"────剪影奔跑","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030080","name":"円香","text":"もう隣合わせではないと知らずに","trans":"却不知道我们已经不再并肩","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030100","name":"円香","text":"全然、帰ってこないし……","trans":"完全，不回来啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030110","name":"円香","text":"………………………………\r\n……暇………………","trans":"………………………………\n……好闲………………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-40","name":"テレビの音声","text":"『CM起用タレントランキング────！』","trans":"“广告起用艺人排行榜────！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-41","name":"テレビの音声","text":"『第一位に輝いたのは、この人──────』","trans":"“荣登第一位的，是这个人──────”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030130","name":"円香","text":"知ってる\r\nわかってる","trans":"我知道\n我明白","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030140","name":"テレビの音声","text":"『浅倉透────！！』","trans":"“浅仓透────！！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030150","name":"円香","text":"違う\r\nこれは夢だ","trans":"不对\n这是梦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030160","name":"円香","text":"だって透は","trans":"因为透她","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030170","name":"円香","text":"私の隣にいる","trans":"就在我身边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030180","name":"透","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030190","name":"透","text":"……？\r\n呼んだ？","trans":"……？\n你叫我？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030220","name":"円香","text":"夢だから\r\nこんなのは","trans":"因为是梦\n这种事","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030230","name":"円香","text":"透が隣にいるなんて","trans":"透居然会在我身边","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030250","name":"円香","text":"何が夢？\r\nどれが夢？","trans":"什么是梦？\n哪个是梦？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030260","name":"小糸","text":"事務所……\r\n行ってみたんでしょ？","trans":"事务所……\n你去看了吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030270","name":"小糸","text":"……？\r\nあの、名刺にあった事務所……","trans":"……？\n就是，名片上那个事务所……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030280","name":"円香","text":"いや、こんな会話、\r\n小糸としたことない","trans":"不对，这样的对话，\n从没跟小糸说过","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030290","name":"円香","text":"じゃ、これは夢──────","trans":"那，这就是梦──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030310","name":"雛菜","text":"……忙しかったのかもね～？\r\n学校も休んでたみたいだし","trans":"……可能是很忙吧～？\n好像学校也请假了呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030320","name":"円香","text":"雛菜とこんな会話もしたことない","trans":"也没跟雏菜这样说过话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030330","name":"円香","text":"これも夢──────","trans":"这也是梦──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030340","name":"円香","text":"夢　夢　夢──────","trans":"梦　梦　梦──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030380","name":"円香","text":"あ……\r\n帰ってたの","trans":"啊……\n你回来了啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030400","name":"円香","text":"起こしてよ","trans":"叫醒我啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030410","name":"透","text":"え？\r\n寝てたし、めっちゃ","trans":"诶？\n你睡得超沉啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030420","name":"円香","text":"ん……\r\n変な夢、見た","trans":"嗯……\n我做了个奇怪的梦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030430","name":"透","text":"おー\r\n変な夢","trans":"哦——\n奇怪的梦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030440","name":"円香","text":"なんか……\r\nよくわからない……夢……？","trans":"怎么说呢……\n不太明白的……梦……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030460","name":"透","text":"それってさ","trans":"那个啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030462","name":"透＆円香","text":"ごっちゃに混ざる夢？","trans":"乱七八糟混在一起的梦？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030480","name":"円香","text":"…………\r\n………あ………？","trans":"…………\n………啊………？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030490","name":"円香","text":"あー……………………\r\n…………今、何時…………","trans":"啊——……………………\n…………现在，几点…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030510","name":"円香","text":"雑誌を枕に、\r\n寝落ちたようだった","trans":"似乎是拿杂志当枕头，\n睡过去了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030520","name":"円香","text":"そこには、いた","trans":"她就在那里","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030540","name":"円香","text":"今度こそちゃんと起きられたようだった","trans":"这次似乎总算好好地醒过来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030550","name":"円香","text":"CM起用タレントランキングにも\r\n透の名前はない","trans":"广告起用艺人排行榜上\n也没有透的名字","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030560","name":"円香","text":"全部、夢","trans":"全部，都是梦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030570","name":"円香","text":"全部全部、くだらない夢","trans":"全部全部，都是无聊的梦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-141","name":"透の母","text":"なんかねー\r\n透、まだかかるみたい","trans":"那个啊——\n透好像还要花些时间","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-142","name":"透の母","text":"夕飯、なんか作っちゃおっか？","trans":"晚饭，要不要我做点什么？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030590","name":"円香","text":"ああ……\r\nいえ、じゃあ今日は帰ります","trans":"啊……\n不用了，那我今天先回去了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010030620","name":"円香","text":"最悪な夢","trans":"最差劲的梦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}